Z||000009||Nashco||11-03-2001||11:24 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://home1.gte.net/jbnash/customtaillights.jpg"> <P>Well, this isn't exactly real looking, or very good quality, but it's an idea.  The perspective is a little screwy, but you get the point <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I was thinking each taillight would be, for visualization purposes only, kind of like long skinny salamis, cut in half lengthwise.  So they'd have a little shape to them and be smooth, to match the car <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Also, I cleared out the reflectors to simulate driving lights in place of the reflectors for back up lights.  I think the stock reflectors look completely ghetto, and back up lights need to be there.<P>Anybody think this is an idea worth fiddling with the image with for?  I could do better, just an idea.<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
